<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Louisiana-Pacific cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Louisiana-Pacific cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns has downgraded Louisiana-Pacific Corp to neutral from attractive, analyst Linda Lieberman said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The reduction was made &quot;just because of recent weakness on oriented stringboard prices...which is their main product,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was unchanged at 21-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
